  "description": "Printable Christmas stickers\nFEATURES:\n🖼 High-Quality Resolution: Our PNG files come with a high-quality resolution of 300 DPI.\n💻 Compatibility: Compatible with all major programs, including Photoshop, Word, and more.\nSPECIFICATIONS:\n– 2790 x 2460 px\n– PNG File Type\n– 9.3 x 8.2 inches\n– 17 PNG file\n– High-quality resolution 300 DPI\n– Compatible with all major programs\nFAQ:\nQ: Is this a physical item?\nA: No, this is a digital download only. No physical items will be shipped.\nQ: Is the design compatible with all major programs?\nA: Yes, the design is compatible with all major programs, like Photoshop, Word, and more.\nQ: What kind of designs can I make with this download?\nA: You can use this design for sublimation design, print and poster design, card making, party invitations, stationery, party tags, blog design, logos, design T-shirts, digital scrapbooking, packaging, greeting cards and more!\nQ: How do I unzip the files?\nA: To unzip the files, you will need a software such as WinZip or 7-Zip. You can download these software for free from their websites. Once you have installed the software, right-click on the zip file and select “Extract All” or “Extract Here”. You will then see the files in a folder.\nThank you",
